# Quote-form lead email via Resend (https://resend.com).
# The ONLY secret needed in Vercel is the API key. Set it in:
#   Vercel -> your project -> Settings -> Environment Variables
RESEND_API_KEY=          # from resend.com -> API Keys (starts with re_...)

# LEAD_FROM and LEAD_TO are NOT secrets and live in the code:
#   app/api/quote/route.ts  (edit those two constants per client site)
# Requires a domain verified in Resend (resend.com/domains) matching LEAD_FROM.
